  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000q6c3](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000q6c3) Magnitude 5.6 earthquake at 109.757 depth occurred on Apr 15 2025 30km W of Koran Va Monjan. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 35.9525 longitude 70.5181. It impacted 34989 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
